{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（19日）早上11時23分，警方接報指，尖沙咀文化中心發生火警，人員到發現火勢已經熄滅，消防人員遂開喉戒備。一名29歲姓周女職員因發生觸電意外，面部及手臂燒傷，經由救護車送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。</p><p>據知，傷者為外判公司職員；經初步調查，相信她於清拆舞台裝置時意外被電傷，案件列工業意外—有人意外受傷。傷者送院時，救護員為她的面部及頭部鋪上敷料。</p><figure><img alt=\"救護員為傷者面部及頭部鋪上敷料。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188823111240388608529671.jpeg/Y3zEqq0Y30h_8z0-elRsh5T3inp3SP0QbOamo0bmpqM\"/><figcaption>救護員為傷者面部及頭部鋪上敷料。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場撲救，約15分鐘將火救熄。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188831674503270400246153.jpeg/uxQa9oIf67SunyBy6mPEbsbb9Cp50kNQ7saUr8TGlK8\"/><figcaption>消防到場撲救，約15分鐘將火救熄。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防人員正調查意外起因。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188832094592176128365419.jpeg/uGXqcL_UHFVsnd9zbYaFNjPfv2vZ8FumnhPYgbQT2IE\"/><figcaption>消防人員正調查意外起因。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"尖沙咀文化中心發生火警，一名20多歲女職員燒傷。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188832703617699840804362.jpeg/Tn6DZeB6Vtaml2WIY7Uwm-1PzwcTMvi7sJ9Q3ZqfUN0\"/><figcaption>尖沙咀文化中心發生火警，一名20多歲女職員燒傷。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊到場撲救。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188832332237246464923104.jpeg/vj-oVrtmOYgdxugqwxxBPT9XllF-P6ZYhNunYK7bp2A\"/><figcaption>消防出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊到場撲救。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊到場撲救。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188832335659929600829430.jpeg/nQ3Cs-cjdrm5MUFK55Ycov0HnVMmmBWT4RI6l8sSOpc\"/><figcaption>消防出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊到場撲救。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"尖沙咀文化中心發生火警，一名20多歲女職員面部及手臂燒傷。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188823113979400192713496.jpeg/-n6YGRSPNAovZXYmXvGtMgII0qe-AnnIsp88oJifPKA\"/><figcaption>尖沙咀文化中心發生火警，一名20多歲女職員面部及手臂燒傷。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名20多歲女職員面部及手臂燒傷送院治理。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188823108539125760816590.jpeg/LhEXzaLijBwAzTmrfu7yzW5rO4a6z85WxAdzXu4Hc14\"/><figcaption>一名20多歲女職員面部及手臂燒傷送院治理。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T07:39:35.541130+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":383,"images":8,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:12:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T09:18:09.940095+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T07:37:53.527800+00:00","content_hash":"1ec4a3f81b7e549e56e5a8219b81d76a7b976bebef5e614131b3973b1ffedb42","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}